versations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "broker ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who buys and sells shares", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Only brokers can work at the stock exchange.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le13ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear at the New York Stock Exchange.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "investor ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who puts an amount of money in a company to see it grow", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Brokers buy shares for the investors.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le13ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "member", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who is a part of an organization or group", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Each broker pays over a million dollars to become a member.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le13ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "trading floor", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the area where brokers work", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Brokers run across the trading floor.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le13ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to shout ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to speak very loudly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Brokers shout orders to buy and sell shares.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le13ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "monitor ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "computer screen; display", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The monitors give information about the stocks.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le13ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn4le13ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Expressing Uncertainty", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You express uncertainty when you are not sure whether something can happen, or whether something is true or not. You can use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">Hang on \u2026 , </span>or <span class=\"italic\">I don't understand</span> to show uncertainty. You use the <span class =\"strong\">Simple Present</span> tense to express uncertainty.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Expressions </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Meaning </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Hang on ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You need a moment to think about it.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I don't understand ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You need more information.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I'm not sure ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You don't think you know or agree.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I suppose ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You may know or agree, but are not sure about it.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Think of an unusual job. What kind of job is it?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Go online and find information about people who have that job.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a paragraph (5-8 lines) about their daily routine.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say if you would like to have their job. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": " Listen to your partner's job description. Is it similar? Different?", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I research online about unusual jobs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about daily work routines.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I express uncertainty.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I listen to a job description and make comparisons.", "type": "text"}]}]}